# Accepted secret-audit findings, one fingerprint per line.
#
# Format:  <path>:<rule-id>:<12-char fingerprint>   # optional note
# Generate candidates with:  python3 tools/audit-secrets.py --baseline
#
# Allowlist fingerprints, never whole paths or whole rules. A wildcard would
# hide a real credential sitting next to the false positive. Anything here
# should be reviewable by a human in a pull request.
